    {
      "id": "d82c5942ab5be08b108a33dfc459be0780f26e24a30fb7035877e3b0d273b4e1",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "0465a29b59d771c3845fad69d0a5667a54448b8a224d49c56687a3aa69babd57",
      "text": "The Model",
      "hash": "1954409637324f1c3f2cab102211fd161a6cd1c270252fc2e1297a69ab9a446b"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2d9cac65f911e97b0f238741f82a307d2721f32a84c9878060ccc0ec58005f8",
      "text": "Output tokens",
      "hash": "a9b50ea0c4a7e3469e7ac21e5497c3b11159a5968330807180eba6b5f0f36bfa"
    },
    {
      "id": "838243cdf0d77238bd7401776847491053fd249e47119c4b30144e5bee8456a0",
      "text": "Tokens the model generates back. Billed at a higher rate than input tokens, since they cost more compute to produce.",
      "hash": "6577769b186cacad59e0e4bd955c582bfe96bfe276cf7065e7973edebd057e44"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d6872b1a393c4b5974d0440de394629714c1a0229751c56f628d938a3a581ba",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "0a2f3ae6440baff75abc24b6a0072348044b0dcc52c28ae6c390532ca0c385b8",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "967c6f02b7fe12c9958576a9405e3d0669774a18843a78ddf2cb4548a386e984",
      "text": "Tokens",
      "hash": "a039dfb9628b53ddaebcfe8ef0793e3fdf19867601295f00d192acef59050869"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c327c9b1342c145868789d1c7364fb9f6faf50558c2b943486b8cdc4d4d63a9",
      "text": "generates back. Billed at a higher rate than",
      "hash": "32391f4dcf1c63ff28187b6de2c4b2df882c211d22075cb2d5771b8659dc3086"
    },
    {
      "id": "c949ce2e4c8a451bc7d5c174f491deca4edeb6d9c7850e538509d883579760cd",
      "text": "input tokens",
      "hash": "f0c1cb4cda1985a408b12908c01227b01065a8cdfc2a03e2106ca60275f27d16"
    },
    {
      "id": "541f08f23f556d93e22982b2fcebbe264c001ba44837537125e3191a334837cb",
      "text": "— commonly around five times the rate — since they cost more compute to produce.",
      "hash": "efa831aee1a661a6d453f1b7050f7a95bdc1bd985af2583ce8a8b4baf14b853f"
    },
    {
      "id": "7fb6d596ca5bcafb916928d6d27d2718bd45f1bc458e4fe9c8b657f5d29c64e9",
      "text": "Everything the model writes counts: the prose you read, the code it emits,",
      "hash": "78361c7187310a0123e8509b4cf3818096d7c4e9d6e30d80c8fe9287ae121d3e"
    },
    {
      "id": "c8656710533edf993345c2d7f8ea12def47723e0b9fb16bfc8b6d87f40044e82",
      "text": "tool calls",
      "hash": "b102cdc6032df9ca67169a6d620fba86a9b0344b8dab71565a5b230deadb5e68"
    },
    {
      "id": "027a68b45ddf1a3f19af5f776ffcf7d7d15d673131df667534d441b94c64e808",
      "text": ", and any extended thinking the model does before answering. That last one surprises people — reasoning tokens are billed as output even when the",
      "hash": "0c29c8b1a2fd4c66eb3a8a19d7ac40069d4270b38eb08a228e4e2541e0c5bbbb"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c973b27bea6ff036fcc708384b8b4e587bd8bad62ace44c9bf001cd56ab0bff",
      "text": "often doesn't show them to you, and turning up",
      "hash": "33e65383c1ddd6e99038fcf3f163242676cdb950e3475a0c6cb1aaa224491e18"
    },
    {
      "id": "025276e10d2bc3033c5954b3b45618e8a77a57098554d256b7aee4bd383d8f74",
      "text": "spends more of them.",
      "hash": "ff495003b70a1eaded759b1992d89b8581ed778cccd27c68d486088b07358edc"
    },
    {
      "id": "5304879332d0e8bf0767e2f4e05c4ba6bf59b2ad91d0d31260d7a7a6a23c72cd",
      "text": "Output tokens also set the pace of a",
      "hash": "aa3cc4de613fe1f9dc676d0db649b6e0ad3edfc2d7cae09cc7cb649e8a30b7b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "53d87190f01224e78369ec46bd70454cdeac1446e2aef539a78bf320d73da5a9",
      "text": ". The model reads input quickly but generates output one token at a time, so when a",
      "hash": "32d1305fc05cbe8e3c05d1041d397c1a2e904c31f3ce90385edc516570f31dcf"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e0be1cc44ab5ecd2910d7971a50d41d56962551922afc6f6b85976112970c06",
      "text": "feels slow, it's almost always the output being written, not the input being read. A long wait usually means a long answer is coming.",
      "hash": "b30da918fda23fcaafd7fdcdd7891fec9ecd269b5761d42ac9ff6d55b1b5f141"
    },
    {
      "id": "df58622480315d1f0a556092aa67045b59bef3e969f838d7312701fc243efdf5",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "307aaa0814fc81f6ac153b026e9acf48e5e33e173db410cb8feb0ca3e99dd3f9",
      "text": "\"The refactor session is burning through credit even though the inputs are small.\"",
      "hash": "53abe95e973d536eda618d72c0eaa1ad3a08d2ce8c6daee32f97ca77aab66652"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c3575ff342dfbe631918461ccfe9b99669424de1379b66fe9306960e0aaece1",
      "text": "\"Agent's rewriting whole files instead of patching. Output tokens cost roughly five times the input rate — get it emitting edits and the bill drops.\"",
      "hash": "1f52e60d6277d9c6308ed895e886c82234a209de7110ce892524784f04085f70"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5b113850f72680d185319dcb4563105039c6ea0bda3703ca60de92490e7c756",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
